A Must for Any House
Whether you need a semi-permanent water supply around the house or just want extra convenience, our premium hose pipe connector kit is the optimal solution for your needs.

Everything You Need
The bundle includes a wall flange, a ½ brass tap with Click-Lock, and PTFE tape for you to have all that is required to add another water source around your home and get your daily chores done more efficiently.

Durable Materials
This tap hose connector is made with top-grade materials that are bound to pass the test of time and will not let you down for a long time. Ideal for garages, farms, gardens, or allotments, our water pipe connector is a must-have.

Easy to Install
One of the best parts about our outdoor tap kit is super easy to install, and anyone could do it. You snap it on and secure it with the wall connector and have a semi-permanent water source for your activities.

Some of the fantastic features of this product:

Premium quality Wall Flange;
Suitable for gardening or around-the-house chores;
Great for creating semi-permanent water supplies;
Top-quality materials used;
Reliable and durable;
Easy to use;
Practical and versatile;
With brass ½ tap;
It comes with PTFE tape;

